{"version": "https://jsonfeed.org/version/1", "title": "MiSTer FPGA Documentation (fork with editorial improvements)", "home_page_url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/", "feed_url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/feed_json_updated.json", "description": "MiSTer FPGA is an open source project that aims to recreate various classic computers, game consoles, and arcade machines, using modern hardware.", "icon": "assets/mister_kun_bw.svg", "authors": [{"name": "Kevin Coleman"}], "language": "en", "items": [{"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/troubleshooting/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/troubleshooting/", "title": "Troubleshooting", "content_html": "<h2>The MiSTer FPGA's correct DIP switch configuration on the DE10-Nano</h2>\n<p>If your keyboard or other low-level hardware doesn't work, one or more of the DIP swi...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/troubleshooting.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:51:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/snes/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/snes/", "title": "SNES", "content_html": "<p>The Super Nintendo Entertainment System (SNES) MiSTer core has many features, such as CPU and Super FX turbo modes, lightgun and mouse support, and a configu...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/snes.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:51:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/video_freak/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/video_freak/", "title": "video_freak", "content_html": "<p><code>video_freak</code> is used to crop and scale the image.</p>\n<p><code>video_freak</code> takes the original <code>VGA_DE_IN</code> and outputs a new <code>VGA_DE</code> and <code>VIDEO_ARX</code>/<code>VIDEO_ARY</code> based...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/video_freak.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:51:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/troubleshooting/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/troubleshooting/", "title": "\u30c8\u30e9\u30d6\u30eb\u30b7\u30e5\u30fc\u30c6\u30a3\u30f3\u30b0", "content_html": "<h2>DE10-Nano \u4e0a\u306e MiSTer FPGA \u306e\u6b63\u3057\u3044 DIP \u30b9\u30a4\u30c3\u30c1\u8a2d\u5b9a</h2>\n<p>\u30ad\u30fc\u30dc\u30fc\u30c9\u306a\u3069\u306e\u4f4e\u30ec\u30d9\u30eb\u30cf\u30fc\u30c9\u30a6\u30a7\u30a2\u304c\u52d5\u304b\u306a\u3044\u5834\u5408\u3001DE10-Nano \u306e DIP \u30b9\u30a4\u30c3\u30c1\u304c1\u3064\u4ee5\u4e0a\u8aa4\u3063\u3066\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3055\u308c\u3066\u3044\u308b\u53ef\u80fd\u6027\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h3>\u4e0a\u6bb5\u306e DIP \u30b9\u30a4\u30c3\u30c1</h3>\n<p>\u56f3\u306e\u3068\u304a\u308a\u306b\u306a\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u304b\u78ba\u8a8d\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\uff1a ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/troubleshooting.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:51:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/highlights/snes/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/highlights/snes/", "title": "SNES", "content_html": "<p>Super Nintendo Entertainment System\uff08SNES\uff09\u306e MiSTer \u30b3\u30a2\u306b\u306f\u591a\u304f\u306e\u6a5f\u80fd\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002CPU \u3068 Super FX \u306e\u30bf\u30fc\u30dc\u30e2\u30fc\u30c9\u3001\u30e9\u30a4\u30c8\u30ac\u30f3\u30fb\u30de\u30a6\u30b9\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3001\u8a2d\u5b9a\u53ef\u80fd\u306a WRAM \u521d\u671f\u5316\u5024\u306a\u3069\u3067\u3059\u3002\u30ea\u30ea\u30fc\u30b9\u3055\u308c\u305f\u62e1\u5f35\u30c1\u30c3\u30d7\u306e\u307b\u307c\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306b\u3082\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3053\u306e\u975e\u5e38\u306b\u5f37\u529b\u306a\u30b3...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/snes.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:51:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/video_freak/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/video_freak/", "title": "video_freak", "content_html": "<p><code>video_freak</code> \u306f\u753b\u50cf\u306e\u30af\u30ed\u30c3\u30d7\u3068\u30b9\u30b1\u30fc\u30ea\u30f3\u30b0\u306b\u4f7f\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<p><code>video_freak</code> \u306f\u5143\u306e <code>VGA_DE_IN</code> \u3092\u53d7\u3051\u53d6\u308a\u3001\u30af\u30ed\u30c3\u30d4\u30f3\u30b0\u30d1\u30e9\u30e1\u30fc\u30bf\u30fc\u306b\u57fa\u3065\u3044\u3066\u65b0\u3057\u3044 <code>VGA_DE</code> \u3068 <code>VIDEO_ARX</code>/<code>VIDEO_ARY</code> \u3092\u51fa\u529b\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<p>```verilog\nmodule ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/video_freak.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:51:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/computer/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/computer/", "title": "Computer Core Networking", "content_html": "<h1>Computer core Internet and console connections</h1>\n<p>Since the May 7, 2018 release, MiSTer supports a serial (UART) connection from FPGA to Linux. Linux runs a ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/computer.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:27:09+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/wifi/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/wifi/", "title": "WiFi", "content_html": "<p>WiFi is optional and simple to set up on the MiSTer. You'll need a compatible dongle, the <code>wifi.sh</code> script (provided with the Mr. Fusion image), and a keyboa...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/wifi.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:27:09+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/computer/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/computer/", "title": "\u30b3\u30f3\u30d4\u30e5\u30fc\u30bf\u30fc\u30b3\u30a2\u306e\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u30ef\u30fc\u30af", "content_html": "<h1>\u30b3\u30f3\u30d4\u30e5\u30fc\u30bf\u30fc\u30b3\u30a2\u306e\u30a4\u30f3\u30bf\u30fc\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u30fb\u30b3\u30f3\u30bd\u30fc\u30eb\u63a5\u7d9a</h1>\n<p>2018\u5e745\u67087\u65e5\u306e\u30ea\u30ea\u30fc\u30b9\u4ee5\u964d\u3001MiSTer \u306f FPGA \u304b\u3089 Linux \u3078\u306e\u30b7\u30ea\u30a2\u30eb\uff08UART\uff09\u63a5\u7d9a\u306b\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002Linux \u306f\u3053\u306e\u63a5\u7d9a\u4e0a\u3067 PPP \u307e\u305f\u306f\u30b3\u30f3\u30bd\u30fc\u30eb\u30c7\u30fc\u30e2\u30f3\u3092\u52d5\u304b\u3057\u3001FPGA \u30b3\u30a2\u304b\u3089\u30a4\u30f3\u30bf\u30fc\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u3084 Linux \u30b7\u30a7\u30eb\u3078\u30a2\u30af...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/computer.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:27:09+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/wifi/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/wifi/", "title": "Wi-Fi", "content_html": "<p>WiFi \u306f\u4efb\u610f\u3067\u3001MiSTer \u3067\u306f\u7c21\u5358\u306b\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002\u5fc5\u8981\u306a\u306e\u306f\u5bfe\u5fdc\u30c9\u30f3\u30b0\u30eb\u3001<code>wifi.sh</code> \u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30d7\u30c8\uff08Mr. Fusion \u30a4\u30e1\u30fc\u30b8\u306b\u4ed8\u5c5e\uff09\u3001\u305d\u3057\u3066 WiFi \u30d1\u30b9\u30ef\u30fc\u30c9\u3092\u5165\u529b\u3059\u308b\u305f\u3081\u306e\u30ad\u30fc\u30dc\u30fc\u30c9\u3060\u3051\u3067\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u63a8\u5968 WiFi \u30a2\u30c0\u30d7\u30bf\u30fc</h2>\n<p>DE10-Nano \u306b\u3082 MiSTer \u62e1\u5f35\u30dc\u30fc\u30c9\u306b\u3082 ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/wifi.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:27:09+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/editing/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/editing/", "title": "Editing These Docs", "content_html": "<p>This guide shows how to edit this documentation site. It's similar to editing a wiki page, with a few extra steps. All edits are approved by the administrato...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/editing.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:26:48+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/editing/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/editing/", "title": "\u3053\u306e\u30c9\u30ad\u30e5\u30e1\u30f3\u30c8\u306e\u7de8\u96c6\u65b9\u6cd5", "content_html": "<p>\u3053\u306e\u30ac\u30a4\u30c9\u3067\u306f\u3001\u3053\u306e\u30c9\u30ad\u30e5\u30e1\u30f3\u30c8\u30b5\u30a4\u30c8\u306e\u7de8\u96c6\u65b9\u6cd5\u3092\u8aac\u660e\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002wiki \u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u306e\u7de8\u96c6\u306b\u4f3c\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u304c\u3001\u3044\u304f\u3064\u304b\u8ffd\u52a0\u306e\u30b9\u30c6\u30c3\u30d7\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306e\u7de8\u96c6\u306f GitHub \u4e0a\u306e MkDocs_MiSTer \u30ea\u30dd\u30b8\u30c8\u30ea\u30fc\u306e\u7ba1\u7406\u8005\u306b\u3088\u3063\u3066\u627f\u8a8d\u3055\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u3053\u306e\u30c9\u30ad\u30e5\u30e1\u30f3\u30c8\u30b5\u30a4\u30c8\u306e\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3092\u7de8\u96c6\u30fb\u30b3\u30f3\u30c8\u30ea\u30d3\u30e5\u30fc\u30c8\u3059\u308b\u65b9\u6cd5</h2>\n<p>...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/editing.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:26:48+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/console/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/console/", "title": "Linux Serial Console", "content_html": "<p>The DE10-Nano board has a console port. It lets you log in to Linux without a network connection and provides debug/info output that is sometimes useful for ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/console.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:25:54+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/midi/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/midi/", "title": "MIDI Features", "content_html": "<p>There are multiple options for using MIDI on the MiSTer.</p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/dwhinham/mt32-pi/wiki\">The mt32-pi Project</a>{target=_blank}</h2>\n<p>Dale Whinham (a...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/midi.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:25:54+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/rtc/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/rtc/", "title": "RTC Board", "content_html": "<p><img alt=\"MiSTer FPGA RTC Add-on board\" src=\"img/rtc1.jpg\"></p>\n<p>Some cores (ao486, Minimig) use a clock, so MiSTer provides them with the real time. When an Internet connecti...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/rtc.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:25:54+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/nes/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/nes/", "title": "NES", "content_html": "<p>The Nintendo Entertainment System (NES) MiSTer core is packed with features:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Automatic Famicom Disk System (FDS) disk swapping</li>\n<li>Custom palette loading</li>\n<li>...</li>\n</ul>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/nes.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:25:54+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/psx/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/psx/", "title": "PSX", "content_html": "<p>The Sony PlayStation (PSX) MiSTer core:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Multiple controller options</li>\n<li>Automatic BIOS region swapping</li>\n<li>Both memory card slots with manual file loading</li>\n<li>S...</li>\n</ul>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/psx.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:25:54+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/saturn/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/saturn/", "title": "Saturn", "content_html": "<p>The Sega Saturn MiSTer core, originally developed by <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/srg320/\">srg320 (Sergey Dvodnenko)</a>{target=_blank}, reproduces the original har...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/saturn.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:25:54+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/tgfx16/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/tgfx16/", "title": "TurboGrafx-16", "content_html": "<p>The <a href=\"https://github.com/MiSTer-devel/TurboGrafx16_MiSTer\">MiSTer TurboGrafx16 core</a>{target=_blank} is a TurboGrafx-16 / PC-Engine implementation. Originally ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/tgfx16.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:25:54+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/console/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/console/", "title": "Linux\u30b7\u30ea\u30a2\u30eb\u30b3\u30f3\u30bd\u30fc\u30eb", "content_html": "<p>DE10-Nano \u30dc\u30fc\u30c9\u306b\u306f\u30b3\u30f3\u30bd\u30fc\u30eb\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u30ef\u30fc\u30af\u63a5\u7d9a\u306a\u3057\u3067 Linux \u306b\u30ed\u30b0\u30a4\u30f3\u3067\u304d\u3001\u554f\u984c\u306e\u8ffd\u8de1\u306b\u5f79\u7acb\u3064\u30c7\u30d0\u30c3\u30b0\uff0f\u60c5\u5831\u51fa\u529b\u3082\u5f97\u3089\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<p>\u4e0b\u306e\u5199\u771f\u3067\u3001\u30dc\u30fc\u30c9\u53f3\u5074\u306e <strong>UART-to-USB\uff08USB Mini-B\uff09</strong> \u30b3\u30cd\u30af\u30bf\u30fc\u3092\u78ba\u8a8d\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\uff1a</p>\n<p>![UART port locat...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/console.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:25:54+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}]}